trace.content:
[TEST] Right hip CT scan — specifically requesting interpretation of:  
- Presence or absence of femoral head fracture or impaction;  
- Integrity of the acetabular posterior wall (fracture, comminution, or displacement >20%);  
- Evidence of intra-articular loose bodies or soft-tissue interposition;  
- Joint congruency post-reduction (if reduction has occurred) or dislocation persistence.

